WEBVTT

00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:30.764
as so many of us do.

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:34.179
And it wasn't until I grew up
and through conflict work

00:09:34.203 --> 00:09:36.222
that I began to stop hiding.

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:40.574
And I realized that gatherings for me,

00:09:40.598 --> 00:09:42.185
at their best,

00:09:42.209 --> 00:09:44.553
allow us to be among others,

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:47.922
to be seen for who we are,

00:09:47.946 --> 00:09:50.081
and to see.

00:09:51.510 --> 00:09:53.718
The way we gather matters

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:57.562
because how we gather

00:09:57.586 --> 00:09:58.880
is how we live.

00:09:59.627 --> 00:10:00.784
Thank you.